    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"feature\">The [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} emanates an aura in a [[lookup @target.template.size activity=oT8238p9jXwVy76c]]-foot Emanation while it doesn't have the Incapacitated condition.</p><p class=\"feature\"><em>Wisdom Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=oT8238p9jXwVy76c]], [[lookup @target.affects.special activity=oT8238p9jXwVy76c]].</p><p class=\"feature\"><em>Failure:</em> The target has the &amp;Reference[Frightened apply=false] condition until the start of its next turn.</p><p class=\"feature\"><em>Success:</em> The target is immune to this [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster}'s aura for 24 hours.</p><div class=\"cat-description\"><p><em>midi-qol: An enemy that starts its turn in the emanation makes the save (not while the fiend is Incapacitated); a success makes it immune to this fiend's aura for 24 hours.</em></p><p><em>Automation requires Coven's Automation Toolkit (CAT).</em></p></div>",
